    "body": "Quick pass (author side, not a review): merges cleanly; sim crate all green, the app verify, golden and adaptive suites green, clippy clean; no existing verdict moved. On purpose, the tolerance excuses only a chord END within `CROSSING_TOUCH` of the other chord's END, not anywhere near its line, following NeoTech's #1134 review. It's pinned by `a_walk_through_a_chord_at_a_vertex_a_picometre_off_its_line_still_warns`. Overlap to note: #1099 adds a line-band `touching()` to the same `crossing.rs`; whichever merges second should keep the end-point rule. Ready for NeoTech's review. (M5)",
